      <li>Prices on this site are in Canadian dollars. Any taxes that apply are added to the listed price.</li>
      <li>The Online Presence Starter is paid upfront, before work begins.</li>
      <li>For other services, the price and when it is due are confirmed with you before work begins.</li>
      <li>Prices on this site can change, but a price we have confirmed with you for a project will not change for that project.</li>
    </ul>

