      <li>Photos, text and other material that you own or have permission to use. You are responsible for the content you send us.</li>
      <li>Timely replies, so we can keep to the timeline.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>5. Timelines</h2>
    <p>The timelines on this site are our normal turnaround, counted from when we have everything we need from you. They are estimates and not guarantees. We will tell you if something is going to take longer.</p>

