    <h2>12. Governing law</h2>
    <p>These terms are governed by the laws of the Province of Ontario and the laws of Canada that apply there.</p>

    <h2>13. Changes</h2>
    <p>We may update these terms from time to time. The date at the top shows when they were last changed. The version on this page when you engage us is the one that applies to that project.</p>

    <h2>14. Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about these terms? {% if site.contact.email %}Email <a href="{{ site.contact.emailHref }}">{{ site.contact.email }}</a> or send{% else %}Send{% endif %} us a message through the <a href="/contact">contact form</a>.</p>

  </div>
</section>

{% endblock %}
